urce src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612100/extras/b07613bc98ef5ca0234f699db078f183.webm?t=1655971431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612100/extras/b07613bc98ef5ca0234f699db078f183.mp4?t=1655971431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PUZZLE-PLATFORMER</strong></h2>Big Earth's intricate puzzles will challenge your creativity and skills. Solve them by using the seeds and energy capsules collected along your way. Jump, dash, change the speed of time, plant your platforms, and don't forget: nature is always on your side (even when it doesn't look like it). Keep an eye open for the resources that will recover the planet and the equipment capable of restoring you to your standard size. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612100/extras/91196974a451789d2b35008cdc47f7dc.poster.avif?t=1655971431\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612100/extras/91196974a451789d2b35008cdc47f7dc.webm?t=1655971431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612100/extras/91196974a451789d2b35008cdc47f7dc.mp4?t=1655971431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612100/extras/b4e05ae1cc41ec90cc370afb4e0b7e45.poster.avif?t=1655971431\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612100/extras/b4e05ae1cc41ec90cc370afb4e0b7e45.webm?t=1655971431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612100/extras/b4e05ae1cc41ec90cc370afb4e0b7e45.mp4?t=1655971431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HEAD UP DISPLAY</strong></h2>Hide the HUD to take photographs and collect memories of the journey. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612100/extras/f2f82d20847207add0e4b176b09f1ece.poster.avif?t=1655971431\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612100/extras/f2f82d20847207add0e4b176b09f1ece.webm?t=1655971431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612100/extras/f2f82d20847207add0e4b176b09f1ece.mp4?t=1655971431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ORIGINAL SOUNDTRACK</strong></h2>Dr Kyle Seed's mesmerising journey is wrapped in an contemplative original soundtrack that transports the player to a relaxing and challenging environment and sets the mood to the adventure.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612100/extras/b68d5c4edc041c66346fb5bc106d8862.poster.avif?t=1655971431\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612100/extras/b68d5c4edc041c66346fb5bc106d8862.webm?t=1655971431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612100/extras/b68d5c4edc041c66346fb5bc106d8862.mp4?t=1655971431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612100/extras/c6bcc8fbae860b7c5da69c11f71fb18a.poster.avif?t=1655971431\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612100/extras/c6bcc8fbae860b7c5da69c11f71fb18a.webm?t=1655971431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612100/extras/c6bcc8fbae860b7c5da69c11f71fb18a.mp4?t=1655971431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612100/extras/bcdd487df3e9b01201bb97d96442a255.poster.avif?t=1655971431\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612100/extras/bcdd487df3e9b01201bb97d96442a255.webm?t=1655971431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1612100/extras/bcdd487df3e9b01201bb97d96442a255.mp4?t=1655971431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
